      "created_at": "2026-02-01T06:51:39.571Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Budget module in ERPNext v16 introduces stricter validations, workflow enforcement, and governance controls compared to ERPNext v15. While these enhancements improve financial control, they create challenges for organizations that previously relied on the simpler and more flexible v15 budgeting model. Since ERPNext does not support direct conversion of v16 budgets back to v15, organizations face difficulties in maintaining continuity with legacy budget processes. This creates a need for configuration and customization strategies that allow ERPNext v16 to replicate v15 budget behavior without compromising system stability and financial integrity.</p>",
